{"reviews":[{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-0","r":2.0,"t":"Did not receive what is pictured.","x":"Did not receive what is pictured, Mine looks completely different. They were thin and cheap","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-1","r":2.0,"t":"Two different orders, definitely not the same.","x":"I ordered these mask twice. The second order the masks are so much bigger. My first order fit fine. But the second ones are too big.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-2","r":5.0,"t":"Good value, decent mask","x":"Value is key. While these are not high quality I would not call them junk. These masks fit nice, do the job, easy to breathe without being too thin and look decent on the face. I am an average sized adult and they fit fine without pulling on my ears. These won\u2019t last forever but they should last plenty of washes and you will get more than your money\u2019s worth.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-3","r":4.0,"t":"Comfortable and soft","x":"Easily available masks... They are reusable that's the best part... But I would like a little think from inside... It's value for money though.  Pls add options of colors if possible ... The lastic is easy to wear and comfortable...","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-4","r":5.0,"t":"Great product for quality price","x":"Great product at a great price! Very pleased. I\u2019ve ordered these masks twice now to personalize for birthday parties and they turned out great! I also like the the masks have a double layer to them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-5","r":4.0,"t":"Black fabric is not Cotton...","x":"I bought these to bleach tie dye. The bleach did not work at all on them. That means the black fabric is some sort of synthetic fabric.  The masks are cheap and of a decent quality.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-6","r":5.0,"t":"My second purchase!","x":"I bought the 5 pack before as I wasn't sure if these would be good or not, but these are so soft, comfortable, and breathable that I bought this 10 pack too now!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-7","r":5.0,"t":"soft and breathable","x":"sleek and lightweight.  washed and dried and they didn't shrink.  There is a pocket if you want to insert a filter as well.  Good value.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-8","r":5.0,"t":"The price was better than any other I found","x":"The softness of the mask  seems good quality.  I havent washed them yet but everything else checks out great","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-9","r":1.0,"t":"Not 100% cotton!","x":"These are not 100%. Bleach will not do anything to them. Frustrated with this purchase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-10","r":5.0,"t":"Comfy","x":"Thin, lightweight and very comfortable. A good buy for the money","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-11","r":5.0,"t":"Great value, nice masks","x":"These masks are awesome! Super comfy and breathable, and they don't tug or cause my ears to hurt after wearing them for 8+ hours a day. They are very easy to wash as well and even have a pocket in them to insert a filter. This pack comes with 10 masks total so I'm never running out or misplacing them. My girlfriend and I keep some in the car, in our work bags, at our desks, and still have some leftover! Overall these masks do the job well while also being at a tremendous value, so I can highly r","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-12","r":2.0,"t":"Not Very Good","x":"I expected a better product from the star ratings I saw on Amazon. It's thinner than I'm comfortable with and has a chemical factory smell to them even after washing them in a washing machine. I definitely would not buy them again. I'll use them as extra masks in my glove box in case I forget to bring my good masks with me.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-13","r":5.0,"t":"great masks","x":"great for not making waste, as disposable masks in this \"pandemic\" are honestly a bit much of a waste.  they are soft and comfortable.  also great for wearing with glasses and them not fogging up.  so comfy--i have traveled on so many planes with them!! Seriosuly!! This is a must if you hate disposable masks!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-14","r":2.0,"t":"Cheaply made but for the price they're better than buying disposables.","x":"The edges of these masks are very poorly lined up for final sewing so you have piece sticking off all of them. The open edge of the white lining is poorly finished as well. The ear loop elastic frayed after a while, too. But you get what you pay for and for the price they're fine. Better than disposable masks.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-15","r":5.0,"t":"I like it very much","x":"The masks are super good. There is no smell. The two-layer packing is very clean and hygienic. I have recommended several friends to buy 50 masks. The price is very close to the people. The seller is also super good. In short, I am very satisfied. I wish the seller a prosperous business","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-16","r":1.0,"t":"Do not recommend at all","x":"Poor quality face mask. Feels extremely flimsy and is very thin. The pocket on the backside to slide your own filter in looks terrible and is gonna be worn out in now time.  Don\u2018t recommend buying this mask at all.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-17","r":4.0,"t":"Good mask for the price","x":"Good mask. Bit thin but good for breathing. If you plan on press HTV on them be sure to cover with the plastic if an already used vinyl sheet. Not jus Teflon or alone they will melt. Lesson learned \ud83d\ude0a","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-18","r":3.0,"t":"On the small size","x":"They seem to be well made, and are soft and comfortable, but seem to be a bit small for my face. I am an average sized adult, so maybe these would fit better on a youth/teenager.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-19","r":3.0,"t":"Clearly cheaply made","x":"I obviously didn't expect high quality. I bought these masks to customize and sell. They are VERY thin, wouldn't protect you from anything. The straps are also poorly sewn on.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-20","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"Me and my girls loved these!! They are not super thick we can breathe with them on. They stay in place I am just happy with these and will be ordering more.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-21","r":5.0,"t":"Don\u2019t wear without filter","x":"Very very thin material. If it didn\u2019t have the pockets for filters I would have returned them. Haven\u2019t worn one yet. When I do I can then speak to comfort","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-22","r":3.0,"t":"Too big for an adult face.","x":"Not a good masks.  It was too big for an adult face. My children cannot wear. I make better masks than this. It is soft but does not fit my face.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-23","r":5.0,"t":"Disappointed.","x":"Bought these masks and they were three ply cotton as described.  Re-ordered these SAME masks and got some polyester two ply loose fitting masks.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B08BHS3GTH-24","r":5.0,"t":"Disappointed.","x":"Bought these masks and they were three ply cotton as described.  Re-ordered these SAME masks and got some polyester two ply loose fitting masks.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find these masks soft, comfortable, and breathable, often praising the fit and value.","cites":[3,4,7,8,9,11,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers describe the masks as thin, lightweight, or cheaply made, with some noting poor finishing or fraying.","cites":[1,11,13,15]},{"text":"Some customers report the masks are not cotton or 100% cotton, noting that bleach does not work on the fabric.","cites":[6,10]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention inconsistent sizing or receiving a product that looks different from what was pictured.","cites":[1,2]},{"text":"Some reviewers note a chemical smell that persists even after washing.","cites":[13]}]},"qa":[]}